[13:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'verge of a revolution. Get it? Like, revolve like a motor. It\'s a revolution. See See what we did? &gt;&gt; Yeah. The electric motor was an amazing idea with some unintended consequences that we\'re now trying to engineer our'

[13:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
